pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例四｜插件审计从访问需求落到安全契约
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 将“插件能读取审计数据”拆分为最小能力集合，并为每个入口定义拒绝条件。
  - elementId: s1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 180, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: s1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 176, 148, 56]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 审计需求
  - elementId: s2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [286, 146, 180, 116]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: s2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [300, 164, 152, 80]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>安全契约</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px">origin · method · path</p>
  - elementId: s3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [512, 158, 180, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: s3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [526, 176, 152, 56]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 能力白名单
  - elementId: s4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [738, 146, 162, 116]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$blue"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: s4t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [752, 164, 134, 80]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>可验证交付</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px">拒绝越权 · 可审计</p>
  - elementId: a1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [240, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: a2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [466, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: a3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [692, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: b1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>需求拆解</strong></p>
        <p>先定义插件可访问的非秘密资源，再定义禁止访问的管理 API、凭证与原始事件。</p>
  - elementId: b2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>实现选择</strong></p>
        <p>插件页面通过宿主 API Client 获取数据；通信层双重校验来源，路径按插件命名空间限制。</p>
  - elementId: b3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>验收口径</strong></p>
        <p>foreign origin、越权 method、路径穿越和缺少 pluginId 均拒绝；合法请求可审计、可解释。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 474, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 方案重点：最小权限、宿主持有凭证、扩展能力可独立演进且不突破核心安全边界。
